{"path":"io/basic_streambuf/sputbackc","title":"std::basic_streambuf<CharT,Traits>::sputbackc","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_streambuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>sputbackc","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/sputbackc","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Puts back a character back to the get area.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">int_type sputbackc<span class=\"br0\">(</span> char_type c <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Puts back a character back to the get area.\n</p><p>If a putback position is available in the get area (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">gptr<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> eback<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>), and the character <code>c</code> is equal to the character one position to the left of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/gptr\">gptr()</a></span> (as determined by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">eq</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c, gptr<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, then simply decrements the next pointer (<span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/gptr\">gptr()</a></span>).\n</p><p>Otherwise, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pbackfail<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">to_int_type</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> to either back up the get area or to modify both the get area and possibly the associated character sequence.\n</p><p>The I/O stream function <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream/putback\"><code>basic_istream::putback</code></a> is implemented in terms of this function.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  c\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  character to put back\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If putback position was available, returns the character that the next pointer is now pointing at, converted to <code>int_type</code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">to_int_type</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>gptr<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. The next single-character input from this streambuf will return this character.\n</p><p>If putback position was not available, returns what <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/pbackfail\">pbackfail()</a></span> returns, which is  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">eof</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> on failure.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_stringstream\"><span class=\"kw1754\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stringstream</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"abcdef\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// gptr() points to 'a' in \"abcdef\"</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Before putback, string holds \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> c1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// c1 = 'a', gptr() now points to 'b' in \"abcdef\"</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> c2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputbackc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'z'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// same as s.putback('z')</span>\n                                         <span class=\"co1\">// gptr() now points to 'z' in \"zbcdef\"</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"After putback, string holds \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> c3 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// c3 = 'z', gptr() now points to 'b' in \"zbcdef\"</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> c4 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// c4 = 'b', gptr() now points to 'c' in \"zbcdef\"</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> c1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> c2 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> c3 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> c4 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputbackc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'b'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// gptr() now points to 'b' in \"zbcdef\"</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputbackc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'z'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// gptr() now points to 'z' in \"zbcdef\"</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> eof <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputbackc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'x'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// nothing to unget: pbackfail() fails</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>eof <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\"><span class=\"kw1899\">EOF</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"No room to putback after 'z'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Before putback, string holds abcdef\nAfter putback, string holds zbcdef\nazzb\nNo room to putback after 'z'</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/sungetc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sungetc</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  moves the next pointer in the input sequence back by one <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream/putback\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>putback</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  puts a character into input stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_istream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_streambuf","title":"std::basic_streambuf"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_streambuf<CharT,Traits>::sputbackc","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Puts back a character back to the get area."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If putback position was available, returns the character that the next pointer is now pointing at, converted to int_type with Traits::to_int_type(*gptr())."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"sungetc","note":"moves the next pointer in the input sequence back by one"},{"label":"putback","note":"puts a character into input stream"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":345,"codeBlockCount":2}
